# The static LTA data and the train timetable are small, public and needed at first boot on a host with no key or disk (Render),
# so those four files are tracked. Anything else in cache/ (backups, scratch) stays out.
cache/*
!cache/bus_stops.json
!cache/bus_routes.json
!cache/bus_services.json
!cache/rail_timetable.json
tmp/
video/node_modules/
video/out/
